#: ../../tools/cod_crystal_tools.rst:32 17b329aafa2a4be2853243b2d2db0a75
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed crystal structure information from the "
"Crystallography Open Database (COD) by COD entry ID. Returns complete "
"crystallographic data including unit cell parameters (a, b, c, alpha, "
"beta, gamma), space group, chemical formula, mineral/compound name, Z "
"value, publication details (DOI, journal, authors, year), diffraction "
"method, and radiation type. Use COD\\_search\\_structures first to find "
"COD IDs, then use this tool for full details on a specific structure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/cod_crystal_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/cod_crystal_tools.rst:67
